@startuml
[*] --> Off
Off --> [*]
state Alarm {
  state Idle
  Idle --> SetAlarm : set alarm time
  SetAlarm --> ActivateAlarm : activate alarm
  ActivateAlarm --> RingAlarm : current time matches set alarm time
  RingAlarm --> StopAlarm : stop alarm
  StopAlarm --> NextAlarm : next scheduled alarm time
}
Off --> Alarm: turn on
Idle --> SetAlarm : set alarm time
SetAlarm --> ActivateAlarm : activate alarm
ActivateAlarm --> RingAlarm : current time matches set alarm time
RingAlarm --> StopAlarm : stop alarm
StopAlarm --> Idle : go back to idle state
NextAlarm --> RingAlarm : next scheduled alarm time
@enduml
